007600
007700 01  WORK-AREA.
007800     05  PAGE-CTR                PIC 9(2)    VALUE ZEROS.
007900     05  LINE-CTR                PIC 9(2)    VALUE ZEROS.
008000     05  AT-LEAST-ONE-ITEM       PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
008100     05  AT-LEAST-ONE-REQ        PIC X       VALUE "N".
008200
008300**** ACCEPT FIELD ****
008400 01  ROUTE-LINE                  PIC X(80)   VALUE SPACES.
008500
008600**** ESCAPE SEQUENCES ****
008700 COPY ESCNAM2 IN COPYLIB.
008800
008900 01  COMPRESS-PRINT              PIC X(8).
009000
009100 01  NORMAL-PRINT                PIC X(8).
009400
009500**** TBLOWUP ****
009600 COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
009700 01  VIEW-COMAREA.
009800     05  FILLER                 PIC X(118)  VALUE ALL "0".
009900     05  FILLER                 PIC S9(4)   COMP-4 VALUE 9999.
010000 01  KSAM-STATUS                PIC X(2)    VALUE SPACES.
010100
010400
