010900**                                                          **
011000**************************************************************
011100**************************************************************
011200
011300 COPY MREQ IN COPYLIB.
011400
011500 COPY DREQITM IN COPYLIB.
011600
011700 COPY DREQDESC IN COPYLIB.
011800
